      "id": "operating-vs-parent-profit-and-special-items",
      "established_scope": "Consolidated Q1 2026-04-01 to2026-06-30 OP1,540 vs priorQ1 3,647; parent NI2,953 vs2,560 (million JPY). Public PL p7 already shows fixed-asset gain71/securities gain1,549/business transfer gain1,000/special-gain total2,620, special-loss total14, PBT4,244 and tax-expense total1,290. Raw displayed sums/rounding are not corrected.",
