      "established_scope": "Saved public p11 states2026-04-01 transfers: Yahagi Jisho development/sales to Meitetsu Urban Development has no transfer PL; Yahagi Building & Life management to Meitetsu Community Life has1,000m gain/special profit. Public p9 says Aquarius all-share acquisition adds it and subsidiary Kaisho (two added entities, not two independent acquisitions); Q1 consolidated CF statement is not prepared.",
